WEBVTT

00:01:29.848 --> 00:01:31.008
And I realize:

00:01:31.032 --> 00:01:34.437
because the Chinese ingratiated themselves

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:37.220
with a small ruling class
here in the United States,

00:01:37.244 --> 00:01:40.782
who stole all of that money
and all of that wealth for themselves.

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:43.596
And the rest of us,
the vast majority of us,

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:44.885
struggle to get by.

00:01:45.389 --> 00:01:48.493
And the Chinese
gave this small ruling elite

00:01:48.517 --> 00:01:51.886
loads of military weapons
and sophisticated technology

00:01:51.910 --> 00:01:54.676
in order to ensure that people like me

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:57.700
would not speak out
against this relationship.

00:01:58.573 --> 00:02:00.009
Does this sound familiar?